\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 5. Short scripts\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Seeking feedback:
\f0\b0 \
"I want to check something \'97 is there anything about how I handled [X] that landed differently than I intended? I'd rather hear it now, straight, than not know."\

\f1\b Pausing before a reactive decision:
\f0\b0 \
"That's useful \'97 give me [an hour / until tomorrow morning] to think it through properly before I respond." 
\f2\i (Internal version: "What's the situation, who's affected, and what would I tell someone else to do here?")
\f0\i0 \

\f1\b Giving credit:
\f0\b0 \
"I want to make sure it's visible that this worked because of [name]'s work on [specific contribution] \'97 that shouldn't get lost."\

\f1\b Repairing harm:
\f0\b0 \
"I've been thinking about [situation], and I think my [comment/decision] landed harder than I meant it to. I'm sorry \'97 can you tell me more about how it affected you, and what would help going forward?"\

\f1\b Responding ethically to conflict:
\f0\b0 \
"It sounds like we're seeing this differently. Let's separate what actually happened from how we're each interpreting it, and find an outcome we'd both be comfortable defending if someone asked us about it later."\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

