\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 7. Final reminder\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 These are self-reported, non-clinical reflective signals from a single voluntary tool \'97 not a diagnosis, not a fixed trait, and not evidence of anything you've done. Treat every point above as a prompt for reflection and low-risk experimentation, not a verdict. Keep these scores private and don't share them with colleagues, direct reports, or managers without your own clear consent \'97 they weren't designed for disclosure, comparison, or any personnel decision. And if any real workplace situation you're weighing involves bullying, harassment, discrimination, safety, or serious misconduct, that belongs with your manager, HR, or another formal channel \'97 not something to navigate solo based on a self-reflection score.\
